@c = http://localhost:8081
### Valid citizen
POST {{c}}/api/citizens
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName":"Ramesh Kumar",
  "email":"ramesh@example.com",
  "phone":"9876543210",
  "aadhaarNumber":"123456789012",
  "gender":"MALE",
  "dateOfBirth":"1995-04-12",
  "wardNumber":12,
  "address":"Sector 5, Coimbatore"
}
###
GET {{c}}/api/citizens
###
GET {{c}}/api/citizens/count
### Invalid values should return HTTP 400 with fieldErrors
POST {{c}}/api/citizens
Content-Type: application/json

{"fullName":"A","email":"wrong","phone":"12345","aadhaarNumber":"1234","gender":"MALE","dateOfBirth":"2030-01-01","wardNumber":500,"address":""}
